# REST

## 1.Admin

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "Test",
    "lastname": "Test",
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "<CODE_FROM_EMAIL>",
    "password": "{{$processEnv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>


## 2.User

### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.2 Register
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Test",
    "email": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$processEnv USER_EMAIL}}"
}

### 2.3.1 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "<CODE_FROM_EMAIL>",
    "password": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}",
    "passwordConfirmation": "{{$processEnv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>